// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Accelerate Metabolism 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P275167913" "Accelerate Metabolism"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1511657802" "PBAoE, Ally +SPD, +Recharge, +Recovery, +Dam +Res(Effects)"
// Power Help Text :
"P1318712485" "Activating this power emits radiation that increases the running speed, attack speed, Endurance recovery, and damage potential of all nearby allies. Affected heroes' metabolisms are increased so much that they become resistant to effects such as Sleep, Hold, Disorient, Immobilization and Endurance Drain. Recharge: Very Long"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P1550301107" "You begin to accelerate your metabolism, and the metabolism of all nearby allies."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P3547230991" "{PlayerSource} boosts your damage, speed, recharge, recovery and resistance to status effects with {PowerName}."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P2942153168" "+SPD, +Recharge, +Recovery, +Dam, +Res(Effects)"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2897583752" "Your metabolism has been boosted.  Your movement speed and attack rate are improved. Your damage and Endurance recovery are increased as well.  Lastly, you are resistant to Sleep, Mez, Disorient, Immobilization and Endurance Drain."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Twinshot_Powers 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P3294930656" "Twinshot's Powers"
// DisplayHelp :
"P127690582" "You're a master of akimbo pistols, wielding a high caliber fire arm in each hand.  Your attacks primarily deal lethal damage and you have a wide variety of attacks, however your strength lies within your ability to use your "Ammo Swap" power to change out your ammo mid-battle.  Doing so can change your secondary damage type and effects making you an incredibly versatile ranged combatant."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Pistols 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2292338111" "Pistols"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P418306962" "Ranged, Minor DMG(Lethal/Special)"
// Power Help Text :
"P1617853395" "Quickly fires a round from one of your heavy automatic pistols. Damage is average, but the fire rate is very fast.  Damage: Minor, Recharge: Very Fast  NOTE: Changing your ammo type with the 'Swap Ammo' power will change your secondary damage from lethal to cold, fire or toxic."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1424371251" "You shoot {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName} for {Damage} points of lethal damage."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P4236434635" "{PlayerSource} shoots you with their {PowerName} for {Damage} points of lethal damage!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1486918477" "You blast {PlayerDest} with your Standard Rounds for {Damage} bonus points of lethal damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2396128565" "{PlayerSource} shoots you with their Standard Rounds for {Damage} points of bonus lethal damage!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1277365587" "You blast {PlayerDest} with your Incendiary Rounds for {Damage} bonus points of fire damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P4056626196" "{PlayerSource} shoots you with their Incendiary Rounds for {Damage} points of bonus fire damage!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3032004507" "You blast {PlayerDest} with your Cryo Rounds for {Damage} bonus points of cold damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P4251115593" "{PlayerSource} shoots you with their Cryo Rounds for {Damage} points of bonus cold damage!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1339705472" "You blast {PlayerDest} with your Chemical Rounds for {Damage} bonus points of toxic damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P682794024" "{PlayerSource} shoots you with their Chemical for {Damage} points of bonus toxic damage!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Dual Wield 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2558716359" "Dual Wield"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P684893882" "Ranged, Moderate DMG(Lethal/Special), Foe Knockback/Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P3641815623" "Dual Wield fires both pistols in rapid succession at its desired target.  This power is slower than Pistols, but deals more damage, and the target may get knocked down by the force of the impact. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Fast  NOTE: Changing your ammo type with the 'Swap Ammo' power will change your secondary damage from lethal to cold, fire or toxic.  Additionally, changing your ammunition type will also change the secondary effect of this attack from Knockback to a minor attack speed and movement speed debuff if 'Cryo Ammo' is loaded, a minor damage over time effect if 'Incendiary Ammo' is loaded, or a -damage effect if 'Chemical Ammo' is loaded."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P2211841663" "Special"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1018046219" "The secondary effect placed on you by a Dual Pistols attack varies depending on the type of ammo used.  If you were struck with Cryo Rounds, you will suffer from a minor slow effect. If you were struck with Incendiary Rounds you will suffer some damage over time.  If you were struck with Chemical Rounds you will have your damage output slightly decreased."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2879437270" "Your Standard Rounds knock {PlayerDest} off their feet!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P82827437" "{PlayerSource} has knocked you off your feet with their Standard Rounds!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3029045350" "Your Incendiary Rounds causes {PlayerDest} to suffer an additional {Damage} points of fire damage."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3894084503" "{PlayerSource} hits you with their Incendiary Rounds causing you to suffer an additional {Damage} points of fire damage."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1235441050" "You blast {PlayerDest} with your Cryo Rounds for {Damage} bonus points of cold damage reducing their attack and movement speed!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P20259028" "{PlayerSource} shoots you with their Cryo Rounds for {Damage} points of bonus cold damage reducing  your attack and movement speed!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P637584215" "You blast {PlayerDest} with your Chemical Rounds for {Damage} bonus points of toxic damage and slightly reduce their damage output!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1968418963" "{PlayerSource} shoots you with their Chemical for {Damage} points of bonus toxic damage and slightly decreases your damage output!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Empty Clips 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2180154381" "Empty Clips"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1399859179" "Ranged (Cone), Moderate DMG(Lethal/Special), Knockback/Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P2032745824" "You empty the clips of both your pistols in an arc of suppression fire. This attack can blast multiple foes in the affected cone area, and has a small chance of knocking some foes down. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Moderate  NOTE: Changing your ammo type with the 'Swap Ammo' power will change your secondary damage from lethal to cold, fire or toxic.  Additionally, changing your ammunition type will also change the secondary effect of this attack from Knockback to a minor attack speed and movement speed debuff if 'Cryo Ammo' is loaded, a minor damage over time effect if 'Incendiary Ammo' is loaded, or a -damage effect if 'Chemical Ammo' is loaded."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Bullet Rain 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1980260676" "Bullet Rain"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1571581867" "Ranged (Targeted AoE), Moderate DMG(Lethal/Special), Knockback/Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P158827151" "You fire your pistols faster than the human eye can follow, causing your bullet trajectory to arc, dealing moderate Lethal damage and possibly knocking your foes back.  Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Slow  NOTE: Changing your ammo type with the 'Swap Ammo' power will change your secondary damage from lethal to cold, fire or toxic.  Additionally, changing your ammunition type will also change the secondary effect of this attack from Knockback to a minor attack speed and movement speed debuff if 'Cryo Ammo' is loaded, a minor damage over time effect if 'Incendiary Ammo' is loaded, or a -damage effect if 'Chemical Ammo' is loaded."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Web Grenade 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3189667928" "Web Grenade"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1642214998" "Ranged, Target Immobilize, -Recharge, -Fly"
// Power Help Text :
"P153366950" "Upon impact, the Web Grenade expels a strong, tenuous, and very sticky substance that can Immobilize most targets. This non-lethal device deals no damage and does not prevent targets from attacking, although their attack rate is Slowed. The Web can bring down flying entities and halts jumping. Recharge: Fast"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P3505771407" "Immobilize, -Fly, -Recharge"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P1730420478" "You have been caught in a web.  You cannot move or fly and your attack speed is reduced."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P362106426" "You Immobilized {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName}!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2175482535" "{PlayerSource} immobilized you with a {PowerName}!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3858553300" "You hit {PlayerDest} with a {PowerName}, slowing their attack and movement rate!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3046173935" "{PlayerSource} hits you with a {PowerName}, slowing your movement rate and attack speed!"

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Crosscut_Powers 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P1200045636" "Crosscut's Powers"
// DisplayHelp :
"P834108901" "Your Super Reflexes and acute senses allow you to react deftly to avoid danger.  Regardless of what comes at you, Super Reflexes simply allows you to avoid the attack. The type of weapon or attack used against you is irrelevant. So swords, bullets, fire, energy, even Psionic Attacks can be avoided. Super Reflexes focuses on different techniques.  Avoiding melee attacks is different than avoiding ranged attacks or even area-of-effect attacks.  Your weakness is your opponents accuracy."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Focused Fighting 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1051970563" "Focused Fighting"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1675020768" "Toggle: Self +DEF(Melee), Res(Confuse, DeBuff DEF)"
// Power Help Text :
"P2170083415" "You become more evasive to melee attacks while you have Focused Fighting activated. This will increase your Defense versus melee as long as it is active. Your Focus also offers you resistance to Confuse effects and DeBuffs to Defense. Recharge: Fast"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P2094825847" "You Focus your Fighting ability and can now easily avoid melee attacks."
// DisplayPowerDefenseFloat :
