"P369601562" "Dark Blast"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P4219235673" "Ranged, Moderate DMG(Negative), Foe -To Hit"
// Power Help Text :
"P2499574216" "A long range blast of dark energy. Deals moderate Negative Energy damage and reduces the target's chance to hit.  Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Fast"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P2190949330" "-To Hit"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2735666026" "The Dark Blast has reduced your chance to hit."
