"P175982904" "Nullify Pain"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1906443399" "PBAoE, Team +Heal"
// Power Help Text :
"P2671953981" "Nullify Pain will heal nearby allies for some hit points by numbing the pain caused by their wounds. Nullify Pain is not as potent as Soothe, but can heal multiple targets at once. Recharge: Moderate"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3262186852" "You nullify some of {PlayerDest}'s pain and heal them for {Damage} points of health."
