// Power Set : Cleopatra 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P2826091210" "Cleopatra"
// DisplayHelp :
"P4173384790" "A compilation of various fighting techniques from around the world, Martial Arts makes you a master in the art of hand to hand combat. Martial Artists tend to be very accurate with their strikes. Like all scrapper powers, all Martial Arts attacks can sometimes land a critical hit for double damage."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
