// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
// Power Help Text :
"P23263651" "You can perform a strong Thunder Kick that hits so hard it can Disorient your target. Damage: Minor, Recharge: Fast"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P3354218589" "Your strike {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName} for {Damage} points of smashing damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3113393502" "{PlayerSource} strikes you with a {PowerName} for {Damage} points of smashing damage!"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
