"P2228365398" "Storm Kick"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2265625443" "Melee, Moderate DMG(Smash)"
// Power Help Text :
"P1897024108" "You can unleash a roundhouse kick that pummels your foe for moderate damage. Storm Kick has a greater then average change to score a critical hit. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Medium"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1516596182" "You pummel {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName} for {Damage} points of smashing damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P1414460940" "{PlayerSource} pummels you with a {PowerName} for {Damage} points of smashing damage!"

