"P1845709286" "Shuriken"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1884795216" "Ranged, Minor DMG(Lethal)"
// Power Help Text :
"P3289859818" "A classic small throwing weapon, you can throw Shurikens at a pretty fast fire rate. You must be level 44 and have Web Grenade or Caltrops before selecting this power. Damage: Minor, Recharge: Fast"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
// Effect VictimHit Message :
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P775112334" "Wounds from your {PowerName} deal an additional {Damage} points of lethal damage to {PlayerDest}."
// Effect VictimHit Message :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Crippling Axe Kick 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P54684661" "Melee, Moderate DMG(Smash), Foe Immobilize, -SPD, -Fly"
// Power Help Text :
"P71319072" "You can perform a Crippling Axe Kick that deals moderate smashing damage, but has a chance to Immobilize your target, as well as Slowing their run speed. Crippling Axe Kick may also knock some flying entities out of the sky. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Moderate"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2878982777" "The Crippling Axe Kick has crippled you.  You are immobilized and your Running speed will be reduced once you can move again."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P792610092" "Your strike {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName} for {Damage} points of smashing damage, Slowing their movement rate and Immobilizing him!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2119426770" "{PlayerSource} strikes you with a {PowerName} for {Damage} points of smashing damage, slowing your movement speed!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
