// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P256474272" "Ranged (Targeted AoE), Moderate DoT(Energy), Foe -End"
// Power Help Text :
"P1307115454" "Hurls a highly charged ball of lightning that explodes on contact. Ball Lightning deals good damage in an area of effect, and drains some Endurance from each target it hits. Damage: Moderate(DoT), Recharge: Slow"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P1831456333" "DoT(Energy)"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P2467806480" "The Ball Lightning is continuing to electrocute you."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P1428594006" "You hit {PlayerDest} with {Damage} points of energy damage from your {PowerName}."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2374480795" "{PlayerSource} hits you for {Damage} points of energy damage with their {PowerName}."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
