"P2124033242" "You can manipulate light and sound to manifest all sorts of Illusions, aiding your allies as well as deceiving your foes."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Spectral Wounds 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2368889973" "Spectral Wounds"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2461111634" "Ranged, High DMG(Psionic), +Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P4084769341" "Spectral Wounds convinces the target that they have taken severe damage. The illusion is so convincing that the victim can fall from the Spectral Wounds. However, the damage is not real, and if the victim survives long enough, the illusion will fade and some of the wounds will heal. Damage: High(Illusionary), Recharge: Moderate"
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2300646149" "Your {PowerName} convinces {PlayerDest} that they took {Damage} points of damage."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Blind 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1665574728" "Blind"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1662844480" "Ranged (Targeted AoE), Moderate DMG(Psionic), Foe Hold/Sleep"
// Power Help Text :
"P3094520607" "Painfully Blinds a single targeted foe so severely that they are rendered helpless. Blind is so bright that additional foes may also be blinded, though they will not take any damage, and attacking them will free them from the effects. Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Moderate"
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P3463939617" "Hold, Sleep"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P129131925" "You have been Blinded."
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P4034150122" "Your hold on {PlayerDest} with your {PowerName} was even more powerful!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P287351733" "{PlayerSource} lands an extra strong hold on you with their {PowerName}!"
// DisplayFloat :
// Effect AttackerHit Message :
"P2010763324" "You Blind {PlayerDest} for {Damage} points of Psionic damage!"
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2583092446" "{PlayerSource} Blinds you for {Damage} points of Energy damage."

