// Display Name :
"P646438851" "Sonic Siphon"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3255195607" "Ranged, Foe -Res(All)"
// Power Help Text :
"P1007995414" "By setting up a constant vibration within the body of your foe, you weaken their Damage Resistance. Affected targets will take more damage from successful attacks.   Recharge: Slow"
// Power AttackerHit Message :
"P3647738614" "Your {PowerName} has reduced {PlayerDest}'s resistances."
// Power VictimHit Message :
"P182951110" "Your resistance to damage has been reduced by the {PowerName} of {PlayerSource}."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P3466742994" "-Res(All)"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P290923559" "Your Resistances have been weakened by the Sonic attack."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Sonic Dispersion 
